    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nAdverse Effects (2) : Dapsone\n\n(1) Agranulocytosis\n(2) Oxidative stress ⇒ Hemolytic anemia\n\n(Anemia in G6PD deficient individuals. Although not mentioned in the sketch, Dapsone is a Sulfa drug)\n\n[Image: ecefdf0d8cb78d50977e1fd27b118aa58f1d425a7c2d2c0fe637b77a1889b830]\n\n[Image: 4f5479aec70015243703a0e5a6dd6788a4b31161a9c2007b5bcad4ac8217f6ad]\n\n[Image: 367e44be218a412d9e3f1cc1817b80c9be49f15126fd36ee3d9918bc29ed13a0]\n\n3.2 - Leprosy drugs\n[Image: 9f64c8b6cd799b90c1d5bab38886b76d852ab4ddf225c0f32487f96ac27ab02a]\n\n[Image: 5cbde7cde668c619432ac4626bf618ce9c0803385dbcc94966c6170aae65a595]\n\n[Image: 505995ba12ea94a5fb79508794040dbb87d6057e4ccda916d0e1a6f547756500]\n\n[Image: c66857d0df3b294d3ab298e6efb998680dd3f682e4c3232e5b162cbe153a6a02]\n\n[Image: 90a31a103ef0fffcc75637778600cc436a650f8d3d57f87fc4c32bc0a56adb24]\n\n[Image: d1154c8aeb901a2ad401929de6aaae9cd3928d354e216d7df1f97ce86df48ee4]",
